"<i class=\"oi me-2\" data-icon=\"block\" title=\"受限\"/>\n"
"                    <strong>注意：</strong>请在 PayPal 上确认您的电子邮件地址"
"，以\n"
"                    接收付款。"

#. module: payment_paypal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:payment_paypal.payment_provider_form
