"<i class=\"oi me-2\" data-icon=\"block\" title=\"Restricted\"/>\n"
"                    <strong>Attention:</strong> You currently cannot receive "
"payments due to a\n"
"                    possible restriction on your PayPal account. Please "
"reach out to PayPal Customer\n"
"                    Support."
msgstr ""
"<i class=\"oi me-2\" data-icon=\"block\" title=\"受限\"/>\n"
"                    <strong>注意：</strong>由于您的 PayPal 账户可能存在限制，"
"您目前无法\n"
"                    接收付款。请联系 PayPal 客户\n"
"                    支持。"

